Review this change for security vulnerabilities.

Changed files (you may Read these and any other file in the repo):
  - macapp/WorkroomApp/Core/AppStore.swift
  - macapp/WorkroomApp/Core/ThemeService.swift
  - macapp/WorkroomApp/Views/KeyboardShortcutsView.swift
  - macapp/WorkroomApp/Views/RootView.swift
  - macapp/WorkroomApp/Views/ThemePicker.swift
  - macapp/WorkroomApp/Views/TitlebarBars.swift
  - macapp/WorkroomApp/WorkroomApp.swift
  - macapp/WorkroomAppTests/SwitcherThemeSweepTests.swift
  - macapp/WorkroomAppTests/ThemeServiceTests.swift
  - macapp/WorkroomAppUITests/ThemePickerUITests.swift

Unified diff (only + lines are new):

